WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.590
An exam desk.

2
00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:02.720
A clock.

3
00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:06.270
One piece of writing,
and the time is ticking.

4
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:09.110
Two students turn over the same task.

5
00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.150
One starts writing at once.

6
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.410
The other jots a few
words in a margin box.

7
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:15.690
Fast forward.

8
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.320
The first page is long and crossed out,
with a final paragraph squeezed in at

9
00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:21.410
the bottom.

10
00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:26.070
So why would anyone spend five
precious minutes not writing?

11
00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.500
In this mission, you'll test
what a plan should hold.

12
00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:30.560
A rough draft?

13
00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:32.090
A list of devices?

14
00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.180
You'll weigh plans for one story
task, and pick the strongest.

15
00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:39.660
And you'll compare two
shapes: one for arguing,

16
00:00:39.710 --> 00:00:41.490
one for telling a story.

17
00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:46.550
Your mission: explain why it's worth
spending five minutes not writing.
